Hello,

Thank you for subscribing to FamilyPlates. Keep this email: it confirms the subscription terms you agreed to and the payment Stripe took.

Plan: FamilyPlates <%= @consent.plan_name %>, <%= @consent.price_label %>, renewing automatically until you cancel.
Agreed on: <%= @consent.accepted_at.utc.to_formatted_s(:long) %> UTC
Terms of Service version: <%= @consent.terms_version %> (<%= @terms_url %>)

Your payment:
Amount paid: <%= @consent.paid_label %> on <%= @consent.paid_at.utc.to_date.to_formatted_s(:long) %><% if @consent.paid_discount_label %>, after a discount of <%= @consent.paid_discount_label %><% end %>
Paid period: <%= @consent.paid_period_start.utc.to_date.to_formatted_s(:long) %> to <%= @consent.paid_period_end.utc.to_date.to_formatted_s(:long) %>
<% if @consent.next_renewal_at -%>
Next renewal: <%= @consent.next_renewal_at.utc.to_date.to_formatted_s(:long) %>, unless you cancel before then
<% else -%>
Next renewal: none, your subscription is set to end
<% end -%>

What you agreed to:
<%= raw @consent.disclosure %>

Refunds:
<%= BillingOffer::REFUND_REQUEST %>

How to cancel:
Sign in to FamilyPlates, open Subscription & Billing (<%= @subscription_url %>) and choose Cancel Subscription. Only the household's billing owner can cancel. Canceling stops the next renewal, and you keep access until the end of the period you have paid for.
